                    971.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "5-6-6 The respective parties shall take official action on the report of the mediator/fact-finder or the fact-finder no later than thirty (30) school days after the meeting described in Section 5-6-5 above.",
            "block_bbox": [
                94,
