        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "5-6-7 To the extent that tentative agreement is reached on the issues in dispute as a result of such mediation/fact-finding, the procedures provided in Sections 5-4-1 and 5-4-2 shall apply.",
            "block_bbox": [
