        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "5-6-9 Either party may request that an official stenographic record of all or part of the testimony taken at the fact-finding hearings be made, and a copy of any transcript shall be provided to the fact-finder. The party requesting a stenographic record shall pay the costs thereof, except that if the other party shall request a copy of any transcript, it shall share equally the entire cost of making the stenographic record.",
